---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "DTU Chip Day 2026 - Archive"
permalink: /archive/2026_dtu/
---

{# Hero #}
<div class="hero">
    <img src="/assets/hero-wafer.jpg" alt="Chip dies on a wafer" class="hero-wafer">
    <div class="date-badge">14 APRIL 2026 &middot; DTU LYNGBY</div>
    <h1>DTU <span>Chip</span>day 2026</h1>
    <p>A half-day conference on the Danish chip design ecosystem &mdash; 12 talks across three sessions on chip education, technical industry work, and research outlooks. This page archives the program, photos, and presentations from the day.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 1rem;"><a href="/archive/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to all events</a></p>
</div>

{# Photo Gallery #}
<section id="photos">
    <h2>Chip Day 2026 in Pictures</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Photos by Hanne Klokkegaard</p>
    <div class="carousel">
        <button class="carousel-btn carousel-prev" aria-label="Previous">&lsaquo;</button>
        <div class="carousel-track">
            {% for i in range(1, 68) %}
            <img src="/archive/2026_dtu/photos/DTUChipDay2026_{{ i | pad(2) }}.jpg"
                 alt="Chip Day 2026 photo {{ i }}"
                 loading="lazy"
                 class="carousel-slide{% if i == 1 %} active{% endif %}">
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <button class="carousel-btn carousel-next" aria-label="Next">&rsaquo;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="carousel-dots">
        {% for i in range(1, 68) %}
        <span class="carousel-dot{% if i == 1 %} active{% endif %}" data-index="{{ loop.index0 }}"></span>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">

{# Sponsors & Exhibitors #}
{% set sponsors = companies | selectattr("sponsor") %}
{% if sponsors | length %}
<section id="sponsors">
    <h2>Sponsors &amp; Exhibitors</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Companies with a stand at DTU Chipday 2026</p>
    <div class="sponsors-logo-grid">
        {% for c in sponsors %}
        <a href="{{ c.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sponsor-logo" title="{{ c.name }}" data-slug="{{ c.name | slugify }}" style="{% if c.scale %}--logo-scale: {{ c.scale }};{% endif %}{% if c.logo_bg %}--logo-bg: {{ c.logo_bg }}{% endif %}">
            <span class="sponsor-fallback">{{ c.name }}</span>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>

<script>
  fetch('/api/logo-status')
    .then(r => r.json())
    .then(data => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.sponsor-logo[data-slug]').forEach(el => {
        const slug = el.dataset.slug;
        if (data[slug] && data[slug].uploaded) {
          const img = document.createElement('img');
          img.src = '/assets/logos/' + data[slug].filename;
          img.alt = el.title;
          el.querySelector('.sponsor-fallback').replaceWith(img);
        }
      });
    })
    .catch(() => {});
</script>

<hr class="divider">
{% endif %}

{# Program with PDF links #}
<section id="program">
    <h2>Program</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">14 April 2026 &mdash; Glassalen, DTU Building 101</p>
    <p style="color: var(--text-dim); max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto; text-align: center;">
        Download links appear next to talks whose speakers consented to publish.
        No link means the deck was kept private by default &mdash; not an oversight.
    </p>

    {% for item in program2026 %}
    <div class="program-item{% if item.type == 'keynote' %} program-keynote{% endif %}">
        <div class="program-time">{{ item.time }}</div>
        <div class="program-content">
            <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
            {% if item.type == "keynote" %}
            <p class="speaker">{{ item.speaker }}{% if item.affiliation %} &mdash; {{ item.affiliation }}{% endif %}</p>
            {% endif %}
            {% if item.description %}
            <p class="speaker">{{ item.description }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            {% if item.type == "keynote" and item.slides_public === true and item.slides_file %}
            <p style="margin-top: 0.4rem;"><a href="/archive/2026_dtu/presentations/{{ item.slides_file }}" class="slide-link">Download slides (PDF) &rarr;</a></p>
            {% endif %}
            {% if item.talks %}
            <ul class="talks">
                {% for talk in item.talks %}
                <li>
                    {% if talk.lightning %}<span class="lightning-badge">Lightning talk</span> {% endif %}<strong>{{ talk.title }}</strong> &mdash; {{ talk.speaker }}{% if talk.affiliation %} ({{ talk.affiliation }}){% endif %}
                    {% if talk.slides_public === true and talk.slides_file %}
                    &middot; <a href="/archive/2026_dtu/presentations/{{ talk.slides_file }}" class="slide-link">slides (PDF)</a>
                    {% endif %}
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
</section>

<hr class="divider">

{# Event context / what happened #}
<section id="about">
    <h2>About the event</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">DTU Chip Day 2026</p>
    <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>The day</h3>
            <p>Over 150 attendees from industry, academia, and government gathered at DTU Lyngby for a half-day of talks, exhibition stands, and networking. The program spanned education in Denmark, technical presentations from industry, and a closing keynote on opportunities for Danish chip design.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>Slides &amp; consent</h3>
            <p>Each speaker chose individually whether to publish their deck. Published slides are PDFs with clear speaker and affiliation attribution. The default for unresponsive or declined speakers is private &mdash; their material stays internal to the event.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>Organisers</h3>
            <p>Chip Day 2026 was organised by a small team from DTU Compute, DTU Electro, IC Works, GN, and Demant, with logistic support from the DTU Conference Office and sponsorship from the Danish chip design community.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 3rem 0 1rem 0;">
    Organiser files: <a href="/archive/2026_dtu/backstage/" style="color: var(--text-dim);">backstage</a> (password protected)
</p>
